models.description:
Stores normalized key-value pairs for product variant options in snapshots. Each entry represents a single option (key, value) associated with a variant snapshot. Ensures 1NF compliance and supports full history tracking per snapshot.

This table enables efficient historical tracking of variant modifications, including color, size, and other option attributes at the time of each snapshot. Each entry is uniquely identified by its snapshot and option key.

Reference: {@link ecommerce_variant_snapshots.id}
